update item_def set description = 'For a grapevine; as wide as its wall. Trellis: ground level, outside a building, against the outer face of a finished solid wall or window. Takes the 4 spots along that side of its tile, one deep; only a trellis on the next side may share the corner spot. With such walls on several sides, it faces the one nearest where it is set down. The wall is checked only when set down or turned: it stays, vine and all, if the wall changes or goes. Trellis: not on a building tile, upstairs, a side with no or an unfinished wall, or against a bay window, a door, a double door, an arch, a fence, a fence gate, an iron-bound gate, a half wall, a shop counter, a railing, a portcullis or a rune gate. A hidden door refuses it only for those its padlock admits; for anyone else it counts as a solid wall. A grape cutting planted at its foot grows up it.' where id = 'trellis';
